[TITLE]
; Free text title for the optimization case.
Optimization of the New York Network (Murphy, Simpson & Dandy, 1993)

[INP]
; EPANET .inp model file. Relative paths may be written from the current
; working directory or from this .ext file location.
./examples/NYT.inp

[OPTIONS]
; Optional section. If Algorithm is omitted, PPNO only runs the mandatory
; Unit Headloss heuristic and FLS-H local refinement.
; Available algorithms: DE DA DIRECT NSGA2 MOEAD MACO PSO
; NSGA2, MOEAD, MACO, and PSO require the optional PyGMO extra: pip install ".[mo]"
Algorithm DE

[PIPES]
; EPANET pipe ID    catalog series
; Each ID must match a pipe/link ID in the EPANET .inp model.
; The catalog series selects which [CATALOG] entries may be assigned to that pipe.
